## Component Interaction Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Spring Boot)
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant PG as Razorpay
    
    rect rgb(200, 240, 255)
    Note right of Customer: AUTHENTICATION
    Customer->>FE: Enter credentials
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email=?
    DB-->>BE: User + BCrypt hash
    BE->>BE: BCrypt verify + JWT generate
    BE-->>FE: {token, user}
    FE->>LocalStorage: Save token
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note right of Customer: BROWSE MENU
    Customer->>FE: Navigate to /menu
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/menu/categories
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/menu/items
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM menu_categories...
    DB-->>BE: Categories + Items
    BE-->>FE: ApiResponse<List<ItemResponse>>
    FE->>Customer: Render menu grid
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note right of Customer: ADD TO CART
    Customer->>FE: Click "Add" on item
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/cart/items {itemId, qty}
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM menu_items WHERE id=?
    BE->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE carts, cart_items
    DB-->>BE: Cart state
    BE-->>FE: ApiResponse<CartResponse>
    FE->>Customer: Update cart badge
    end
    
    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
    Note right of Customer: CHECKOUT & ORDER
    Customer->>FE: Click Checkout
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/cart/checkout/quote
    BE->>DB: Recalculate from cart_items + menu_items
    BE-->>FE: CheckoutQuoteResponse
    FE->>Customer: Show address form + totals
    Customer->>FE: Submit address
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/orders {idempotencyKey, address}
    BE->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    BE->>DB: Check idempotency_records
    BE->>DB: Recalculate prices from DB
    BE->>DB: INSERT orders, order_items, order_item_modifiers
    BE->>DB: INSERT order_status_events (PLACED)
    BE->>DB: INSERT idempotency_records
    BE->>DB: DELETE cart_items
    BE->>DB: COMMIT
    BE-->>FE: OrderResponse (order_number, PLACED)
    FE->>Customer: Redirect to /orders/{id}
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 230, 240)
    Note right of Customer: ORDER PROCESSING
    Staff->>FE: Open Staff Dashboard
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/staff/orders?status=PLACED
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE outlet_id=? AND status='PLACED'
    BE-->>FE: Order queue
    Staff->>FE: Accept Order
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/staff/orders/{id}/accept
    BE->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status='CONFIRMED'
    BE->>DB: INSERT order_status_events
    BE-->>FE: Updated OrderResponse
    Staff->>FE: Advance: PREPARING → READY_FOR_PICKUP
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/staff/orders/{id}/status {newStatus}
    BE->>DB: UPDATE + INSERT event
    BE->>DeliverySvc: createOfferForOrder()
    BE->>DB: INSERT delivery_assignments (OFFERED)
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 250, 220)
    Note right of Customer: DELIVERY
    Partner->>FE: Open Delivery Dashboard
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/delivery/available
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM delivery_assignments WHERE status='OFFERED'
    BE-->>FE: Available orders
    Partner->>FE: Accept assignment
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/delivery/assign
    BE->>DB: UPDATE delivery_assignments SET status='ACCEPTED'
    Partner->>FE: Mark Picked Up
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/delivery/orders/{id}/pickup
    BE->>DB: UPDATE status='PICKED_UP', orders status='OUT_FOR_DELIVERY'
    Partner->>FE: Update Location (periodic)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/delivery/orders/{id}/location
    BE->>DB: INSERT delivery_tracking
    Partner->>FE: Mark Delivered
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/delivery/orders/{id}/delivered
    BE->>DB: UPDATE status='DELIVERED', orders status='DELIVERED'
    end
```

## Deployment Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT"
        subgraph "DMZ"
            LB[Load Balancer\nAWS ALB / NGINX]
            WAF[WAF\nRate Limit, IP Block]
        end
        
        subgraph "APP TIER (Auto Scaling Group)"
            APP1[Spring Boot Pod 1\nPort 8080]
            APP2[Spring Boot Pod 2\nPort 8080]
            APP3[Spring Boot Pod N\nPort 8080]
        end
        
        subgraph "DATA TIER"
            Primary[(MySQL Primary\nMulti-AZ)]
            Replica[(MySQL Replica\nRead Replica)]
            Redis[(Redis Cluster\nSession/Cache)]
        end
        
        subgraph "STATIC ASSETS"
            S3[S3 Bucket\nFrontend Build\nCloudFront CDN]
        end
        
        subgraph "OBSERVABILITY"
            Prometheus[Prometheus\nMetrics]
            Grafana[Grafana\nDashboards]
            Loki[Loki\nLogs]
            AlertManager[AlertManager\nPagerDuty/Slack]
        end
    end
    
    Client[🌐 Customers\n📱 Staff\n🛵 Partners] --> WAF
    WAF --> LB
    LB --> APP1
    LB --> APP2
    LB --> APP3
    APP1 --> Primary
    APP2 --> Primary
    APP3 --> Primary
    APP1 --> Redis
    APP2 --> Redis
    APP3 --> Redis
    Primary --> Replica
    LB -->|Static Files| S3
    APP1 --> Prometheus
    APP2 --> Prometheus
    APP3 --> Prometheus
    APP1 --> Loki
    APP2 --> Loki
    APP3 --> Loki
```

## Data Flow Summary

| Flow | Protocol | Frequency | Data Volume |
|------|----------|-----------|-------------|
| Menu Browse | REST/JSON | High (per session) | ~50 items × 1KB |
| Cart Operations | REST/JSON | Medium | ~1-10 items |
| Order Creation | REST/JSON | Low (per order) | ~5KB |
| Order Status Poll | REST/JSON | Every 5-10s | ~2KB |
| Location Updates | REST/JSON | Every 5-10s (delivery) | ~500B |
| Payment Webhook | HTTPS/JSON | Per payment | ~2KB |

